{"id": 13427, "title": "Where is the subway station？", "level": "Intermediate", "hsk_tags": ["HSK3"], "slug": "where-is-the-subway-station%ef%bc%9f", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/13427_where-is-the-subway-station.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["A：不好意思，请问附近有地铁站吗？", "B：最近的地铁站应该是世纪公园站，在商场旁边。", "A：你知道怎么走吗？", "B：从这条路一直往前走，穿过一个小花园，到花园后门左转，再过两个十字路口，你就能看到国家图书馆了，图书馆对面就是世纪公园的商场。商场附近应该有三、四个地铁站入口。", "A：谢谢你！但是，你说得太快了，能再说一遍吗？", "B：好吧……其实，你也可以打车到地铁站。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["A：不好意思，請問附近有地鐵站嗎？", "B：最近的地鐵站應該是世紀公園站，在商場旁邊。", "A：你知道怎麼走嗎？", "B：從這條路一直往前走，穿過一個小花園，到花園後門左轉，再過兩個十字路口，你就能看到國家圖書館了，圖書館對面就是世紀公園的商場。商場附近應該有三、四個地鐵站入口。", "A：謝謝你！但是，你說得太快了，能再說一遍嗎？", "B：好吧……其實，你也可以打車到地鐵站。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["A： bù hǎo yì si， qǐng wèn fù jìn yǒu dì tiě zhàn ma？", "B： zuì jìn de dì tiě zhàn yīng gāi shì shì jì gōng yuán zhàn， zài shāng chǎng páng biān。", "A： nǐ zhī dào zěn me zǒu ma？", "B： cóng zhè tiáo lù yī zhí wǎng qián zǒu， chuān guò yī gè xiǎo huā yuán， dào huā yuán hòu mén zuǒ zhuǎn， zài guò liǎng gè shí zì lù kǒu， nǐ jiù néng kàn dào guó jiā tú shū guǎn le， tú shū guǎn duì miàn jiù shì shì jì gōng yuán de shāng chǎng。 shāng chǎng fù jìn yīng gāi yǒu sān、 sì gè dì tiě zhàn rù kǒu。", "A： xiè xie nǐ！ dàn shì， nǐ shuō de tài kuài le， néng zài shuō yī biàn ma？", "B： hǎo ba …… qí shí， nǐ yě kě yǐ dǎ chē dào dì tiě zhàn。"], "english_paragraphs": ["A: Sorry, is there a subway station nearby?", "B: The nearest subway station should be Century Park Station, next to the shopping mall.", "A: Do you know how to get there?", "B: Go straight ahead from this road, pass through a small garden, turn left at the back door of the garden, and after two more intersections, you will see the National Library. Opposite the library is the shopping mall in Century Park. There should be three or four subway station entrances near the mall.", "A: Thank you! But you spoke too quickly. Can you say it again?", "B: Okay... Actually, you can also take a taxi to the subway station."], "english_full": "A: Sorry, is there a subway station nearby?\n\nB: The nearest subway station should be Century Park Station, next to the shopping mall.\n\nA: Do you know how to get there?\n\nB: Go straight ahead from this road, pass through a small garden, turn left at the back door of the garden, and after two more intersections, you will see the National Library. Opposite the library is the shopping mall in Century Park. There should be three or four subway station entrances near the mall.\n\nA: Thank you! But you spoke too quickly. Can you say it again?\n\nB: Okay... Actually, you can also take a taxi to the subway station.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">A</span><span class=\"tr\">A</span><rt></rt></ruby>：<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bù hǎo yì si\" data-defn=\"to feel embarrassed / to find it embarrassing / to be sorry (for inconveniencing sb)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5;6\"><span class=\"si\">不好意思</span><span class=\"tr\">不好意思</span><rt>bù hǎo yì si</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"qǐng\" data-defn=\"please (do sth)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">请</span><span class=\"tr\">請</span><rt>qǐng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wèn\" data-defn=\"to ask; to inquire\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">问</span><span class=\"tr\">問</span><rt>wèn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"fù jìn\" data-defn=\"nearby; neighboring / (in the) vicinity (of); neighborhood\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">附近</span><span class=\"tr\">附近</span><rt>fù jìn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yǒu\" data-defn=\"to have; there is\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dì tiě\" data-defn=\"underground railway; subway / subway train\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">地铁</span><span class=\"tr\">地鐵</span><rt>dì tiě</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhàn\" data-defn=\"